      "action": {
        "required": "optional",
        "summary": { "text": "使うには、MCP サーバーの有効化と D365 Snapshot Debug / D365 ATTACH DEBUG 権限セットが必要", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Permissions and limitations", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] }
      },
      "beforeAfter": {
        "after": { "text": "エージェントに**失敗するシナリオを説明**すると、次に再現したセッションを記録し、スナップショットを回収します。F7 / Alt+F7 の操作は不要です", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Snapshot debugging with an AI agent (MCP server)", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] }
      },
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "how-it-works",
          "heading": "仕組み",
          "availability": "present",
          "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            { "text": "3 つのツール: 初期化（待機）・状態確認・停止（スナップショットの回収）", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Snapshot debugging with an AI agent (MCP server)", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "セッション ID は任意。省略すると次の再現セッションを記録し、指定すると実行中のセッションに直接接続する", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Session ID is optional", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "回収したスナップショットは Visual Studio Code のデバッガーで開ける", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Snapshot debugging with an AI agent (MCP server)", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "how-to-start",
          "heading": "使い始めるには",
          "availability": "present",
          "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            { "text": "ALTool を .NET ツールとして導入し、launchsnapshotmcpproxy を MCP ホストに登録する", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Set up the server", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "Visual Studio Code では AL 拡張が MCP サーバーを自動登録する。Claude CLI や GitHub Copilot CLI も使える", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Visual Studio Code", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "エージェントに事象を伝え、待機状態になったと言われたら自分で再現する", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Session ID is optional", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "prerequisites-limits",
          "heading": "前提・制限",
          "availability": "present",
          "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            { "text": "エージェントは自分の ID と権限の範囲で動作し、操作は自分のユーザーとして監査される", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Permissions and limitations", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "待機中のセッションは 30 分以内に接続されないと閉じられ、開始後は 10 分以内に終了する必要がある", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Permissions and limitations", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "related-features",
          "heading": "手動の方法との違い",
          "availability": "present",
          "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            { "text": "記録の仕組みは従来のスナップショット デバッグと同じ。F7 / Shift+F7 / Alt+F7 の操作をエージェントが代行する", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Snapshot debugging with an AI agent (MCP server)", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "手動では他ユーザー対象のときだけ必要な D365 ATTACH DEBUG が、自分のセッションでも必要", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Permissions and limitations", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "use-case",
          "heading": "活用のヒント",
          "availability": "present",
          "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            { "text": "AL の実行時エラーは自動で取得される。それ以外の行を見たいときだけスナップポイントを指定する", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "What to tell the agent when you arm a snapshot", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "スナップショットには顧客の個人データが含まれ得るため、不要になったら削除する", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/devenv-snapshot-debugging", "locator": "Snapshot debugging with an AI agent (MCP server)", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] }
          ]
        }
